\b AstroPhoto - installation information\b0\par\par
Installs AstroPhoto for the current Windows user, with a Start menu shortcut. Windows administrator consent is required to stage the signed ZWO USB driver.\par\par
Canon EDSDK, ZWO ASI runtime, Microsoft Visual C++ x64 runtime, ASTAP and G05/W08 star catalogs are included. The MSI stages the signed ZWO camera driver automatically. Canon uses Windows inbox PTP support. Installation is offline; no separate SDK, Visual Studio or runtime setup is required. Windows 10 or Windows 11 x64 and a working OpenGL graphics driver are required. The runtime manifest is in dependencies/manifest.json; mandatory third-party notices are in licenses.\par\par
Camera support uses Canon EDSDK. Third-party components remain subject to their respective terms; notices are included in the licenses folder. This installer does not grant additional rights to redistribute Canon software.\par\par
Settings and captured images are stored beside the application. Uninstall removes installed program files and leaves user-created settings and images. Choose a writable installation folder.\par
